296.0000 /
' IRMA phonopy-backed noncubic mode-2 production example.              '/
' Exact coherent+incoherent one-phonon S(a,b) plus the auto-sized      '/
' incoherent multiphonon background from the vendored graphite phonopy '/
' model (40x40x40 mesh, 10000/1000 powder directions, 296 K).          '/
/
